Introducing **The Egg Handbag** – an exquisite luxury handbag that combines timeless elegance with exceptional craftsmanship.

Featuring a stunning Chèvre leather inlay, this handbag exudes sophistication and style. The delicate French-style hand stitching adds a touch of artisanal charm, showcasing the meticulous attention to detail.

Crafted from hand-milled Italian veg-tanned leather, The Egg Handbag epitomizes luxury. The rich, supple leather not only looks and feels luxurious but also ages beautifully, developing a unique patina over time.

Designed with functionality in mind, The Eggs Handbag offers two convenient outside pockets and two inside pockets, providing ample storage for your essentials. Whether it's your phone, keys, or makeup, everything will find its place in this thoughtfully designed handbag.

The handbag comes with a shoulder strap adorned with brass buckles, allowing you to carry it effortlessly wherever you go. Additionally, an optional fringe is available, adding a playful and whimsical touch to your style.

Indulge yourself in luxury with The Egg Handbag, a true statement piece that complements any outfit and elevates your fashion game to new heights.

## Additional informations

This leather good is 100% handmade, from cutting, to assembling, as well as stitching and buffing the leather.

Count 1 week of delay so I can finish my current orders. Add 2 to 3 weeks for the making. Add 5 days to 3 weeks for the delivery depending on your country.

